#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Paralelni upiti"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "Pozadinski sustav za paralelne upite"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Odaberite način izvršavanja paralelnih FlowView upita. Naslijeđeni PHP pokretač račva proces flowview_runner.php za svaki upit i fragment. FlowView usluga upita šalje isti map-reduce zadatak dugotrajnoj Go usluzi putem adrese localhost, čime se izbjegava pokretanje procesa po upitu i kašnjenje pri prozivanju baze podataka. Zahtijeva da usluga flowview-query (pogledajte plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) bude instalirana i pokrenuta."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Naslijeđeni PHP pokretač"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "FlowView usluga upita"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL usluge upita"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "Osnovni URL FlowView usluge upita, na primjer http://127.0.0.1:8699. Ostavite prazno za automatsko otkrivanje privremenog priključka iz datoteke priključka usluge."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Datoteka priključka usluge upita"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Putanja do datoteke priključka u koju FlowView usluga upita zapisuje svoju povezanu adresu. Koristi se za otkrivanje krajnje točke usluge kada je gornji URL usluge upita prazan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Token usluge upita"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Neobavezna dijeljena tajna. Kada je postavljena, Cacti je šalje FlowView usluzi upita kao zaglavlje \"Authorization: Bearer\", a usluga odbija svaki zahtjev koji mijenja stanje ako ne sadrži isti token. Postavite odgovarajuću vrijednost u konfiguracijskoj datoteci usluge (auth_token) ili u varijabli okruženja FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN. Preporučuje se kad god je usluga dostupna bilo čemu osim pouzdanim lokalnim procesima."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj istodobnih niti"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Najveći broj niti koje će se pokrenuti za izvršavanje FlowView upita. Imajte na umu da možete imati najviše 1 nit po particiji baze podataka te trebate paziti da ne preopteretite poslužitelj baze podataka prevelikim brojem istodobno aktivnih niti."

#: setup.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Onemogućeno"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
